<title>JAPAN: Tokai Konetsu Kogyo -1996 group results.</title>
<headline>Tokai Konetsu Kogyo -1996 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.56		vs	    6.28</p>
<p> Operating	   71    million	  vs	  298    million</p>
<p> Current	     84    million	  vs	  309    million</p>
<p> Net		   29    million	  vs	  184    million</p>
<p> EPS		    1.77 yen	  vs	   10.94 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	     -		vs		 -</p>
<p>NOTE - Tokai Konetsu Kogyo Co Ltd is a large maker of silicon carbide heating elements and heating equipment. Its net was down 84.2 pct.</p>
</text>
